        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "5941c26e-3c84-3ec7-8908-763578d86cbe",
                "word": "vigoureusement",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5177984f-a7ed-3963-95dd-38b1cc41b027",
                        "entry_id": "5941c26e-3c84-3ec7-8908-763578d86cbe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Avec vigueur."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f99603f3-0b13-4705-b18f-cff6a8957244",
                                "sense_id": "5177984f-a7ed-3963-95dd-38b1cc41b027",
                                "text": "[…] et la plupart des héros d'arguments ont le génie de la nation française : ils attaquent vigoureusement, mais sont perdus s'ils sont réduits à la guerre défensive."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "df00c615-8e42-443f-82cd-df79b3c11d34",
                                "sense_id": "5177984f-a7ed-3963-95dd-38b1cc41b027",
                                "text": "Elle [l'androsace ciliata] végète vigoureusement dans des situations bien plus froides encore ; je l’ai recueillie couverte de fleurs au haut du glacier de Tuquerouye,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "70b99bce-55f3-4df6-a331-8ffb29754fcd",
                                "sense_id": "5177984f-a7ed-3963-95dd-38b1cc41b027",
                                "text": "La ramie jaune et la ramie rouge sont acclimatées en Indochine. Pourtant elles poussent moins vigoureusement ; elles ne périclitent pas, mais leurs tiges sont moins belles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c51fe4b1-e0cc-429e-bd3a-b3530feadb7c",
                                "sense_id": "5177984f-a7ed-3963-95dd-38b1cc41b027",
                                "text": "Il empoigna Bert par l’épaule, et le secoua vigoureusement, accompagnant ses gourmades d’objurgations irritées et le repoussant avec violence en arrière."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "941877d5-81ea-4cd9-b451-bc61e379f2f9",
                                "sense_id": "5177984f-a7ed-3963-95dd-38b1cc41b027",
                                "text": "Grande donc fut sa surprise lorsque, […], il se vit appréhender vigoureusement par deux douaniers qui s’étaient dissimulés dans l’intérieur du taillis et dont il n’avait naturellement pu soupçonner la présence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5dc5f2f0-ef97-4bce-862b-70a322658e09",
                                "sense_id": "5177984f-a7ed-3963-95dd-38b1cc41b027",
                                "text": "C’est souvent problématique, notamment pour les autorités, mais il ne peut y avoir de système démocratique fort si les journalistes ne remplissent pas librement et vigoureusement leur rôle."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "be554ac0-bf39-34b1-adc3-541cee024038",
                        "entry_id": "5941c26e-3c84-3ec7-8908-763578d86cbe",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Fortement, avec force."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "Peinture"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "ee07004e-e0ca-4207-879f-0f6fc66f4314",
                                "sense_id": "be554ac0-bf39-34b1-adc3-541cee024038",
                                "text": "La blancheur des toiles que portent les paludiers, nom des gens qui cultivent le sel dans les marais salants, contraste vigoureusement avec les couleurs bleues et brunes des paysans, avec les parures originales et saintement conservées des femmes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "ca1b4c47-e330-4ae3-bbab-5378906d9506",
                                "sense_id": "be554ac0-bf39-34b1-adc3-541cee024038",
                                "text": "Tableau vigoureusement colorié."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "058ea0f9-8255-4467-9ec2-35e0fc62d35a",
                        "source_entry_id": "5941c26e-3c84-3ec7-8908-763578d86cbe",
                        "target_lang_word": "energetically",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "energetically",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e7bb73c9-7cd3-37e2-bb0c-dc84ee5fc0dd",
                                        "entry_id": "b0782b57-20fe-35ac-a296-b68556865d0d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In an energetic manner; with great energy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "77e59ffc-da3e-4d98-a259-a3f8c64ec574",
                                                "sense_id": "e7bb73c9-7cd3-37e2-bb0c-dc84ee5fc0dd",
                                                "text": "With a stride, the doctor reached the bed, and seizing her arms worked them energetically, applying what I knew to be artificial respiration."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24eae641-1bed-3101-99d3-28e61e715abd",
                                        "entry_id": "b0782b57-20fe-35ac-a296-b68556865d0d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "By means of energy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f716cef-736f-448f-a7ef-e297206ba641",
                                                "sense_id": "24eae641-1bed-3101-99d3-28e61e715abd",
                                                "text": "Reiki attempts to heal the body energetically."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "719691d7-f286-4985-ad21-8b50e45ce849",
                        "source_entry_id": "5941c26e-3c84-3ec7-8908-763578d86cbe",
                        "target_lang_word": "strongly",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "strongly",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6d3d14ac-af4b-37f5-a381-6c116db9f812",
                                        "entry_id": "af9c15eb-1a79-3f5f-ba18-ff49b3c75060",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a strong or powerful manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0cab9880-b4f6-478e-9339-361370ae1e89",
                                                "sense_id": "6d3d14ac-af4b-37f5-a381-6c116db9f812",
                                                "text": "In the third race, Renowned Blaze finished strongly to win, paying sixteen dollars."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d6e9390f-1427-3046-8234-aeed605fb38d",
                                        "entry_id": "af9c15eb-1a79-3f5f-ba18-ff49b3c75060",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very much."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "679027a4-39f3-470e-9bdc-6435455316ff",
                                                "sense_id": "d6e9390f-1427-3046-8234-aeed605fb38d",
                                                "text": "His reply was strongly suggestive of a forthcoming challenge to the governor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc73affe-667e-49b9-9479-efe7b43ed3fc",
                                                "sense_id": "d6e9390f-1427-3046-8234-aeed605fb38d",
                                                "text": "The humor of my proposition appealed more strongly to Miss Trevor than I had looked for, and from that time forward she became her old self again; for, even after she had conquered her love for the Celebrity, the mortification of having been jilted by him remained."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04b9a76d-76b6-4211-99f3-44d099fb3369",
                                                "sense_id": "d6e9390f-1427-3046-8234-aeed605fb38d",
                                                "text": "As Denmark takes over the presidency of the European Union, Danes are more strongly pro-European than at any time in the past two decades – a shift in sentiment that can at least partly be attributed to US President Donald Trump."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a63e523b-a509-44df-9f64-75622cda2f2b",
                        "source_entry_id": "5941c26e-3c84-3ec7-8908-763578d86cbe",
                        "target_lang_word": "vigorously",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "vigorously",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "729bc63f-eae3-378c-b649-d4efd0f21bd0",
                                        "entry_id": "2cc09f34-15d7-375f-bfa6-4d50c158cbca",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "With intense energy, force or vigor"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8069d356-c851-4ad9-864c-9cf0fbd6cd69",
                                                "sense_id": "729bc63f-eae3-378c-b649-d4efd0f21bd0",
                                                "text": "The lawyer vigorously defended her client."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "049bbf24-adf8-492d-838a-2a9905eef4b4",
                                                "sense_id": "729bc63f-eae3-378c-b649-d4efd0f21bd0",
                                                "text": "He knocked vigorously on the door."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "458b11a2-ea4e-4f57-a7b8-a8255fc0b7e5",
                                                "sense_id": "729bc63f-eae3-378c-b649-d4efd0f21bd0",
                                                "text": "The tender roared along vibrating vigorously; braking had resulted in \"flats\" on most of its tyres."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d8e9ed56-1628-4c18-bdfa-aa41431b2489",
                                                "sense_id": "729bc63f-eae3-378c-b649-d4efd0f21bd0",
                                                "text": "For some writers, the flowering of chamber music around 1910 represents a reaction against the gargantuanism cultivated so vigorously in the previous century."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2055b169-4412-4508-b672-b49db152b487",
                                                "sense_id": "729bc63f-eae3-378c-b649-d4efd0f21bd0",
                                                "text": "Recently, the Supreme Court justices Sonia Sotomayor and Amy Coney Barrett spoke together publicly about how members of the court speak civilly to one another while disagreeing, sometimes vigorously, about the law."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fa3e9a9-79c8-47d4-9bc5-12de1d8f88d7",
                                                "sense_id": "729bc63f-eae3-378c-b649-d4efd0f21bd0",
                                                "text": "“As soon as I am inaugurated, I will direct the Justice Department to vigorously pursue the death penalty to protect American families and children from violent rapists, murderers, and monsters. We will be a Nation of Law and Order again!” Trump wrote on Truth Social, echoing his long-standing advocacy for use of the death penalty, which was part of his tough-on-crime rhetoric during the 2024 campaign."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "164fe0ae-c9f6-496b-9197-c3b98b5a5a7a",
